  "title": {
   "en": "Anata no Ai Nado Irimasen"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "あなたの愛など要りません"
   },
   {
    "en": "I don't need your love"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "“Go Back to the One You Love… Don’t Worry About Me.”\n\nEven knowing she would only ever be a wife in name, Rachel agreed to marry the kingdom’s famed knight and commander of the royal guard, Hendrick—a man she had long admired from afar.\nBut the loveless marriage slowly began to eat away at her soul, leaving her only one source of strength: her beloved son, Lancelot.\n\nOne day, however, a tragic accident claimed her life…\nAnd just as her eyes closed for the last time—\nthey opened again.\n\nShe found herself back on the day of her wedding, as if time itself had granted her a second chance.\n\nWill she choose to live the same way all over again?\nOr this time… will she take fate into her own hands?\n\nA story of heartbreak, rebirth, and a love that just might bloom the moment we stop waiting for it.",
   "ja": "「どうぞ愛する人の所へお戻りください 私のことはお構いなく」形ばかりの正妻と知りながら、憧れの王国騎士団長・ヘンドリックと結婚したラシェル。愛のない結婚生活に精神を蝕まれるラシェルだったが、ようやく授かった息子・ランスロットが心の支えとなっていた。しかし、ある事件をきっかけに彼女は命を落としてしまう。目を覚ますと結婚式の日に時間が巻き戻っていて――！？"
  },
